 "_doc": "Margarita visual styles. A style sets shape, type scale, rhythm, alignment and which blocks it leaves out. It never sets colors: the user's palette does. fonts are a fallback pairing used only when the brand's own fonts are unknown (log as [inferred]). canvas: which end of the palette the email background should take. Retuned 2026-11-04 from 30 Margarita library reference emails (button radius is bimodal: 0-4px or pill; premium brands use one flat canvas and sentence case), with 10px labels at ~0.28em tracking.",
